02:000303DA 64DC            	  3196:     bcc  _L_z01_UpdateTrap_Full_DrawAndCheckCollisions
                            	  3197:     ; Determine the vertical direction toward Link;
                            	  3198:     ; and if Link and the trap are at the same Y, then we can't move
                            	  3199:     ; along this axis. Go draw and check object collisions.
