                            	   767: UpdateBlock_JumpTable:
02:00039C82 00039C8E        	   768:     dc.l    UpdateBlock0Idle   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00039C86 00039D78        	   769:     dc.l    UpdateBlock1Moving   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
