                            	 13532: _L_z04_SetUpDroppedItem_LookUpItem:
                            	 13533:     ; Look up the base offset of the row in the drop item table.
                            	 13534:     ; Add it and WorldKillCycle to look up the dropped item for
                            	 13535:     ; this object type and store it in [00].
